  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Piles of legal manuals, stern teachers, and experience in the courtroom
    have instructed you in legal matters. You're capable of mounting a prosecution
    or defense in court, and you tend to keep abreast of local laws, as you never
    can tell when you might need to know them on short notice. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Charisma , and one is a free attribute
    boost. You're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Legal Lore skill. You gain
    the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Group Impression] skill feat.
